config E2E_SLOT0_HEADER
	bool "Seed slot0 header and device id for UpdateHub on QEMU (test only)"
	depends on FLASH_MAP
	help
	  RAM-backed simulated flash starts erased, so there is no image
	  header for the UpdateHub client to read its firmware version from.
	  Seed one before the application starts.
